  "scanDegradedDemoBody": "实时扫描未运行。macOS 需要“使用 App 期间”定位和签名版实时 ScanCore。iOS 无法完整扫描；Android WifiManager 受限流限制；Linux 使用公共 NetworkManager D-Bus；Windows 仅关联链路。",
  "@scanDegradedDemoBody": {
    "description": "TS MessageKey: scan.degraded.demo.body"
  },
